WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:03.333 --> 00:00:07.433
[Subtitles by danielsangeo]

00:00:09.800 --> 00:00:10.967
Hm.

00:00:10.967 --> 00:00:15.433
I thought I'd like this calm. And
I do, but it's making me nervous.

00:00:15.433 --> 00:00:19.500
Like, a plane's going to pass by overhead
in five minutes and just bomb me.

00:00:19.500 --> 00:00:21.633
That's what I'd do if I wasn't me.

00:00:21.633 --> 00:00:25.667
But thankfully I do not
have to worry about that!

00:00:25.667 --> 00:00:28.800
Being me, that is. The bomb
thing could still be real.

00:00:28.800 --> 00:00:34.300
Yes, an outsider might be tempted to say it
sucks to be me, but that's a common mistake.

00:00:34.300 --> 00:00:39.233
It's still awesome being me. What
sucks is everything AROUND me.

00:00:39.233 --> 00:00:41.467
And on that, they'd have a point.

00:00:41.467 --> 00:00:45.233
Truth be told, I'm still not
thinking outside the box enough.

00:00:45.233 --> 00:00:48.367
Really, I'm just moving
from one box to another box.

00:00:48.367 --> 00:00:50.800
Shouldn't be surprised when I feel boxed in.

00:00:52.233 --> 00:00:54.567
But this self-help box
bullshit doesn't mean much

00:00:54.567 --> 00:00:57.500
when you die if you touch
the sides of the box.

00:00:57.500 --> 00:00:59.467
So no shit I'm still in the box!

00:00:59.467 --> 00:01:01.900
What I NEED to do is get off the grid.

00:01:04.067 --> 00:01:10.100
Though that's easier...said than
done. That's...really the worst part.

00:01:10.100 --> 00:01:11.667
Like, I've been ready...

00:01:12.900 --> 00:01:15.900
...for people to come kill me, ever since...

00:01:15.900 --> 00:01:19.000
Jeez, I guess since
Bobby took my LEGOs.

00:01:19.000 --> 00:01:20.802
That was when it first dawned on me.

00:01:20.802 --> 00:01:23.400
And of course SUSPECTING
people want to kill me

00:01:23.400 --> 00:01:27.000
versus them actually taking a
shot at it, yeah that's new.

00:01:27.000 --> 00:01:29.633
But even that's not as bad as the tracking.

00:01:29.633 --> 00:01:31.867
I mean, they're probably
watching me right now.

00:01:31.867 --> 00:01:35.900
...if not the aliens, then the CIA,
waiting to push me back into the ring.

00:01:35.900 --> 00:01:39.300
I need to fake my own
death--that's the way out of this.

00:01:39.300 --> 00:01:43.233
But see, that's going to be a problem.
If I do that, I've gotta do it right.

00:01:43.233 --> 00:01:44.533
Oh, what the fuck?!

00:01:44.533 --> 00:01:45.800
All right! Back to the--

00:01:45.800 --> 00:01:50.467
NO! IT'S CLOSING! SOMEBODY SHUT IT
BEHIND ME! THEY MUST HAVE BEEN HIDING!

00:01:50.467 --> 00:01:51.867
I THOUGHT I GOT EVERYB--oof!

00:01:52.400 --> 00:01:54.933
Oh my God, this is so bad!

00:01:54.933 --> 00:01:58.333
I'M BOXED IN! IT'S NOT
JUST A METAPHOR ANYMORE!

00:01:58.333 --> 00:02:02.500
Tell me this goes somewhere!
It has to! It fucking has to!

00:02:02.500 --> 00:02:06.633
Yeah, hi! You're like a kite, but evil.

00:02:06.633 --> 00:02:09.733
What the hell? That doesn't look good!

00:02:09.733 --> 00:02:10.700
[explosions]
WUAHH!

00:02:10.700 --> 00:02:12.533
[explosions]
Doesn't sound good either!

00:02:12.533 --> 00:02:14.633
[Hunter-Chopper firing]
WUAAAAHHH! AAAAAA!

00:02:14.633 --> 00:02:17.300
THAT DOESN'T STOP BEING TERRIFYING!

00:02:17.300 --> 00:02:21.067
Oh no, does the channel end?!
IT CAN'T! I WON'T LET IT!

00:02:21.067 --> 00:02:22.567
OH! THERE'S MORE WATER!

00:02:22.567 --> 00:02:24.700
C'MON, GRAVITY! DON'T LET ME DOWN NOW!

00:02:24.700 --> 00:02:26.633
[explosions]
WAIT, NO! LET ME DOWN!

00:02:26.633 --> 00:02:29.467
YES! GOOD! I'M A GOOD HAMSTER!

00:02:29.467 --> 00:02:31.467
[Hunter-Chopper firing]
OH! HO! HO! HO! HOOOO!

00:02:31.467 --> 00:02:36.233
YEAH! I GET IT! I'M GOING! DON'T
FUCKING RUSH ME! I'M NERVOUS AS IT IS!

00:02:36.233 --> 00:02:37.133
[Hunter-Chopper charging]
A tunnel!

00:02:37.133 --> 00:02:38.000
A little more...!

00:02:38.000 --> 00:02:39.733
[Hunter-Chopper firing]
AAAAH! Oof!

00:02:39.733 --> 00:02:42.000
SEE?! I MISSED! YOU'RE NOT HELPING!

00:02:42.000 --> 00:02:44.133
YOU'RE JUST ANOTHER STUPID BACKSEAT DRIVER

00:02:44.133 --> 00:02:46.267
WHO THINKS HE KNOWS
EVERYTHING AND YOU DON'T!

00:02:46.267 --> 00:02:48.833
I HAD TO DEAL WITH PEOPLE
LIKE YOU MY ENTIRE LIFE

00:02:48.833 --> 00:02:52.233
AND NOW YOU HAVE AN
ATTACK-CHOPPER! FUCK EVERYTHING!

00:02:52.233 --> 00:02:52.933
BLAH!

00:02:54.900 --> 00:02:57.350
Okay... I need a minute...

00:02:58.033 --> 00:03:00.367
Ugh, it smells like ass in here.

00:03:00.367 --> 00:03:03.200
Let's keep going. Maybe he'll get confused.

00:03:03.200 --> 00:03:04.700
I'm confused.

00:03:04.700 --> 00:03:07.733
Oh, only one exit. That's not promising.

00:03:07.733 --> 00:03:09.333
Uh, is it this way?

00:03:09.333 --> 00:03:11.233
No, it's not. It's this way.

00:03:11.233 --> 00:03:13.533
Wait! There IS no "this way"!

00:03:13.533 --> 00:03:15.200
[Hunter-Chopper firing]
WAAAAA AAAAH!

00:03:15.200 --> 00:03:18.867
Oh, this is it! He's in a perfect
position! Nothing but kill shots!

00:03:18.867 --> 00:03:21.133
All it takes is one in my head and I'm done!

00:03:21.133 --> 00:03:24.600
Why is he hesitating? Maybe he's
confused why I'm not dead yet.

00:03:24.600 --> 00:03:25.667
That's understandable.

00:03:26.133 --> 00:03:27.267
What is he doing?

00:03:27.267 --> 00:03:29.700
[explosions]
He's dropping those deluxe cherry bombs again.

00:03:29.700 --> 00:03:32.700
I don't know why;
they're not very effective.

00:03:32.700 --> 00:03:36.267
They're about what I would expect
from higher-end fireworks, y'know?

00:03:36.267 --> 00:03:37.733
[Hunter-Chopper firing]
AAAAAAAAHHH!

00:03:37.733 --> 00:03:40.433
THAT WASN'T A COMPLAINT! THE BOMBS ARE FINE!

00:03:40.433 --> 00:03:43.100
LET'S KEEP GOING WITH THE BOMB
GAME! YOU SEEM TO LIKE IT!

00:03:43.100 --> 00:03:46.533
I admit I'm surprised how many
you seem to have, actually!

00:03:46.533 --> 00:03:49.900
Oh look! See, almost got me there! Ha ha!

00:03:49.900 --> 00:03:54.695
Yeah, just stop shooting me, and I think
we'll have a good working relationship here.

00:03:54.695 --> 00:03:57.033
Actually, these are starting
to give me a headache,

00:03:57.033 --> 00:04:00.367
but that's so small, it's
almost not worth mentioning.

00:04:00.367 --> 00:04:03.433
In fact, I feel like I've really
gained a lot of perspective on just...

00:04:04.100 --> 00:04:08.467
...horrible and terrible things
happening to me over and over again.

00:04:08.467 --> 00:04:10.000
What are those bombs, though?

00:04:10.000 --> 00:04:13.233
At first, I thought they were
depth charges, but they float.

00:04:13.233 --> 00:04:16.000
Wow, and how many of those does he have?

00:04:16.000 --> 00:04:17.233
Do they even fit?

00:04:17.233 --> 00:04:18.467
[Hunter-Chopper charging]
IT'S SPINNING UP!

00:04:18.467 --> 00:04:20.300
[Hunter-Chopper firing]
NO! NO! NO!

00:04:20.300 --> 00:04:21.500
NYUUAAAAH!

00:04:21.500 --> 00:04:22.167
Oof!

00:04:22.167 --> 00:04:24.867
JUST STOP IT! STOP TRYING TO KILL ME!

00:04:24.867 --> 00:04:25.533
Cover!

00:04:25.533 --> 00:04:28.200
EVERYBODY ELSE WHO'S TRIED
TO KILL ME IS EITHER DEAD

00:04:28.200 --> 00:04:30.300
OR ONE OF US WOULD'VE MOVED ON BY NOW!

00:04:30.300 --> 00:04:31.033
Oof!

00:04:31.033 --> 00:04:33.367
YOU'RE LIKE SOME CRAZY STALKER EX!

00:04:33.367 --> 00:04:34.967
THIS IS TORMENT!

00:04:34.967 --> 00:04:38.300
GOD DAMMIT! WHY DID THE SPOOK
HAVE TO TAKE MY ROCKET LAUNCHER?!

00:04:38.300 --> 00:04:41.133
Okay! Maybe he knew I
would've used it before now!

00:04:41.133 --> 00:04:45.167
WEL NOW IS THE TIME!
NOW IS THE FUCKING TIME!

00:04:45.167 --> 00:04:46.011
Oh! Oh?!

00:04:46.967 --> 00:04:49.667
Yeah, Jesus CHRIST!

00:04:49.667 --> 00:04:50.833
It's caged up.

00:04:50.833 --> 00:04:54.033
I get two SECONDS of peace here.

00:04:54.033 --> 00:04:57.933
Oh, shit. There's a thought.
Yeah, I'd better keep moving.

00:04:57.933 --> 00:05:01.467
What if CIA himself is
the one in the helicopter?

00:05:01.467 --> 00:05:03.833
No wonder he'd want to take my weapons!

00:05:03.833 --> 00:05:08.667
Wh-whoa! Whoa-hoo! Hooo..hooo...!
Oh--No! Stop! AAAAH!

00:05:08.667 --> 00:05:12.133
Okay, don't...no! NO! Yes! Oh boy!

00:05:13.000 --> 00:05:13.833
WHOO HOO!

00:05:14.567 --> 00:05:18.267
But yeah, that would be ten kinds of
messed up if he was the pilot, too.

00:05:18.267 --> 00:05:21.867
That would mean none of this is real;
it's all just an excuse to hunt me.

00:05:21.867 --> 00:05:24.367
Oh no-o-o-o!

00:05:24.367 --> 00:05:25.567
Maneuvers!

00:05:25.567 --> 00:05:27.400
[Hunter-Chopper firing]
BLAAAAAH!

00:05:27.400 --> 00:05:29.033
STOP THE RAIN OF DEATH!

00:05:29.033 --> 00:05:30.333
I CAN'T TAKE IT!

00:05:30.333 --> 00:05:31.533
IT'S TOO MUCH!

00:05:32.433 --> 00:05:33.300
Oh no..

00:05:33.300 --> 00:05:35.767
Okay, somebody had my idea!

00:05:35.767 --> 00:05:37.167
And it works!

00:05:37.167 --> 00:05:38.367
Wow...

00:05:38.367 --> 00:05:38.867
Nnngh!

00:05:38.867 --> 00:05:41.733
[multiple explosions]
Oh God! Just get me out of here!

00:05:42.733 --> 00:05:43.667
OOF!

00:05:43.667 --> 00:05:45.400
BLAAAAH!

00:05:45.400 --> 00:05:47.100
So, if he's trying to kill me,

00:05:47.100 --> 00:05:50.467
that would be a high level of
deception even for the CIA.

00:05:50.467 --> 00:05:53.933
Actually, wait. If he's been lying
to me, why not lie about everything?

00:05:53.933 --> 00:05:54.733
Whuah!

00:05:54.733 --> 00:05:55.367
Shit...

00:05:56.100 --> 00:05:57.233
RAGH!

00:05:57.233 --> 00:06:00.133
DON'T FLIP THE BOAT! RULE NUMBER ONE!

00:06:00.133 --> 00:06:02.133
C'mon...go! Go go go go GO!

00:06:03.233 --> 00:06:05.067
Eh, stop! Red light.

00:06:05.767 --> 00:06:06.800
Okay, now! Go!

00:06:06.800 --> 00:06:08.500
[Hunter-Chopper firing]
WUAAAAH!

00:06:08.500 --> 00:06:11.567
STOP! THAT WAS SO CLOSE TO MY HEAD!

00:06:11.567 --> 00:06:14.233
BUT YEAH! HE TALKED ABOUT HIS EMPLOYERS!

00:06:14.233 --> 00:06:16.133
HOW DO I KNOW IF EVEN THAT'S TRUE?!

00:06:16.133 --> 00:06:17.833
WHAT IF THERE ARE NO EMPLOYERS?!

00:06:17.833 --> 00:06:19.200
WHAT IF HE'S THE EMPLOYER?!

00:06:20.067 --> 00:06:25.867
BECAUSE IT'S NOT ENOUGH TO HUNT ME FOR BLOOD
SPORT! HE WANTS TO PLAY HIS MIND GAMES, TOO!

00:06:25.867 --> 00:06:28.600
THAT'S WHY HE ONLY
SHOOTS ME SOME OF THE TIME!

00:06:29.200 --> 00:06:32.300
CHRIST! GET THIS CRAP OUT OF HERE!

00:06:32.300 --> 00:06:36.467
CONGRATULATIONS! YOU WON
A BOAT! HAPPY SAILING!

00:06:36.467 --> 00:06:37.018
Fuck...

00:06:37.767 --> 00:06:39.400
It's a dead end!

00:06:39.400 --> 00:06:40.210
No!

00:06:40.210 --> 00:06:40.667
Not--

00:06:40.667 --> 00:06:42.167
[Hunter-Chopper firing]
DYAAAAGH!

00:06:42.167 --> 00:06:44.867
Oh my God! This is breaking me!

00:06:44.867 --> 00:06:48.367
YEAH, HE SAYS HE HAS EMPLOYERS
BECAUSE THAT'S THE PERFECT EXCUSE!

00:06:48.367 --> 00:06:51.967
'IT'S NOT ME DOING THIS TO YOU!
I'M JUST FOLLOWING ORDERS!'

00:06:51.967 --> 00:06:56.767
IT'S LIKE HE WATCHED THE NUREMBERG TRIALS,
THEN TOOK THE EXACT WRONG LESSON FROM THAT!

00:06:56.767 --> 00:06:58.267
[Hunter-Chopper firing]
Hoo! Hoo! Hoo!

00:06:59.300 --> 00:07:01.433
YOU MISSED, YOU SON OF A BITCH!

00:07:01.433 --> 00:07:04.400
YEAH, YOU'RE FOLLOWING
ORDERS! ORDERS FROM YOURSELF!

00:07:04.400 --> 00:07:08.733
THEN YOU CAN TURN AROUND AND PRETEND LIKE
YOU'RE ON MY SIDE, YOU RATFUCK PSYCHO!

00:07:08.733 --> 00:07:10.267
WUAAAAAH!

00:07:11.300 --> 00:07:14.767
That's it! I'm out! I'm done!
I'm fucking done! No more!

00:07:14.767 --> 00:07:16.467
[loud explosion]
OOOH!

00:07:16.467 --> 00:07:19.100
Oh God! I felt THAT one!

00:07:19.100 --> 00:07:23.967
OOOH HOO HOO HOO! MAKE IT
STOP! JUST MAKE IT ALL STOP!

00:07:23.967 --> 00:07:31.863
[hyperventilating]

00:07:34.400 --> 00:07:37.196
I changed my mind!
I don't want to be a pilot!

